---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About - My Own Radio" description="About Vivek and this project.">
  <div class="container">
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <p>
    I'm Vivek &mdash; a data engineer who spends his free time on trails and in
    questions that don't have neat answers. This site is where I write down both:
    the treks and travels, and an ongoing attempt to understand who I am and what
    any of this is for, read through Hinduism, other traditions, and philosophy.
  </p>
  <p>
    "My Own Radio" is a longer-running project. This journal is its first phase.
    Later it grows into something you can listen to as well as read.
  </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-title {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    margin-block: 3.5rem 2rem;
  }
</style>
